The 0.001 N study shows the tongue rotates and closes the lower opposite-side clearance under the applied moment. At 80 N, SolidWorks raised its excessive-displacement prompt, so the helper correctly stopped before reading that result. I’m checking a diagnostic full-load solve with the contact already demonstrated, then I’ll judge whether it is a stable contact result.
